name: Backup batch retry/backoff policy
description: Scheduled-backup transient-failure retry — 546/429/RateLimit only, 2 retries with 5s/15s backoff, BATCH_SIZE_RETRY=1 (ADR-082, single-table isolation), RETRY_BUDGET_MS=8min, hard-fail terminal preserved
type: feature
